  "body": "According to the spec, Yes:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/window-object.html#set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object seems to capture parent's referrer policy dynamically.\r\n\r\nChromium and Safari: Yes\r\nFirefox: No\r\nWPT PR: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/22783\r\n\r\nSimilar issue in API base URL: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/421\r\n\r\nI prefer taking a snapshot at creation time, in the context of https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4926",
